# fal.ai credentials — COPY this file to `.env` (same folder) and paste the real key.
# The real `.env` is gitignored (never uploaded). This `.example` is safe to commit.
#
# Get the key at https://fal.ai/dashboard/keys  ->  "Create new key"  (see docs/fal-ai-setup.md)
# It starts with "key_". Keep it secret; if it leaks, delete it there and make a new one.

FAL_KEY=key_PASTE_YOUR_REAL_KEY_HERE
